00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:20.860
looking at their brain while they're awake
while they're functioning. And the more you

00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:25.360
do that the more you realize how little we
understand and actually know about the brain.

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:30.590
So without further ado we're really privileged
to have a tremendous group of participants.

