to individual people who are most likely to

00:50:12.550 --> 00:50:13.550
benefit from that.

00:50:13.550 --> 00:50:17.020
And can you find different patterns of patients
based on fMRI?

00:50:17.020 --> 00:50:23.650
Yeah. So we've found, I always emphasize I
